+  // Local patch (2026-11-08): run the configured "on-hover" command,
+  // dispatched exactly like click commands. Waybar upstream never
+  // exposes hover to modules; this is what lets a pill react when the
+  // cursor enters it (e.g. show its level bar while hovered).
+  // Entering cancels any pending hover-out dispatch (see the
